{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>機電署指，已完成巡查所有「臺日電梯」負責的樓宇，再發現多186幢無安裝耐火門框組件，累計338幢。</p><p></p><p>佔整體「臺日」負責的383幢樓宇中的八成八，除了兩個屬之前公布的租置屋邨，其餘都是私人屋苑。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LIFT-2000_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026I9wa4gUfhZ1792415186.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>機電署稱該兩個租置屋邨，連同五幢私人樓宇，安裝門框的工程已展開，並已動員升降機商會等協助，除非情況特殊，其他安裝可在數天內開始。有關「臺日」的違規行為會進行相關規管工作。至於其他承辦商的巡查，暫時未有發現。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T13:39:53.209254+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T13:37:41.406296+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:37:41.406296+00:00","content_hash":"a7d1bf807ecba58f32c40ac1d40898c5f1b56ccda068f9fcb379c6032b0460d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}